      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_27A_NOA_BT_VICTORY",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_WEST_ROD",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "오늘 <color=#F7BE45>[쿠쿠]</color>의 컨디션이 별로 좋지 않았던 것 같지만…?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "今日の<color=#F7BE45>「クゥクゥ」</color>のコンディションはあまり良くなかったみたいだけど…？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
